%YAML 1.1
%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: e9620f8c34305754d8cc9a7e49e852d9, type: 3}
  m_Name: DialogLocalizationTable_en
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  m_LocaleId:
    m_Code: en
  m_SharedData: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 555e031b6ab57ea47a26da4db4a1ebac, type: 2}
  m_Metadata:
    m_Items: []
  m_TableData:
  - m_Id: 147044159660032
    m_Localized: Ugh... my head... Where am I?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044197408768
    m_Localized: The red emergency light flickered around me, casting a dim glow.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044197408769
    m_Localized: I can't... think. What was I doing here?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044197408770
    m_Localized: "Then, a memory suddenly flashed through my mind. I was fighting
      fiercely with someone... \nand the cure ampoule in my hand shattered. After
      that, everything went blank"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044205797376
    m_Localized: Right then, the computer screen flickered to life and a message
      appeared on it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044205797377
    m_Localized: "\"===== Emergency Biohazard System Activated ===== \nFacility containment
      complete. External communications blocked. Infected: 5 \nVaccine storage location:
      [Encrypted], Vaccine storage quantity: 2 \nAwaiting facility override code...\""
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044205797378
    m_Localized: '...Infected: 5? Infected? Vaccine? What on earth happened?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044205797379
    m_Localized: Don't move.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044205797380
    m_Localized: "I slowly turned around. On one side of the lab, four women were
      staring at me. \nBut... their appearance was different from ordinary humans."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044205797381
    m_Localized: 'One had dog-like ears sprouting from her head.

      Another had
      sharp, fox-like eyes and ears.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044205797382
    m_Localized: 'One''s long, rabbit-like ears were trembling.

      And the last
      one had sheep-like horns visible on their head.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044205797383
    m_Localized: "Without realizing it, I looked down at my hands. My fingertips
      tingled. Filled with anxiety, I looked into a nearby broken mirror. \nAnd...
      on top of my head, too... something was growing."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044205797384
    m_Localized: You... you're awake. Thank goodness. You're a researcher, right?
      You know what happened here, don't you?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044205797385
    m_Localized: "There is something I definitely remember. That we gathered in this
      room for an experiment. \nBut when I opened my eyes, the facility was shut
      down... and our bodies were changed like this. Explain it, researcher."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044205797386
    m_Localized: '*Sob*... why... why has everyone turned so strange? I''m scared...'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044205797387
    m_Localized: This... wasn't here before. Why did something like this appear?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044205797388
    m_Localized: "I looked at them. Clearly, I was connected to them. \nBut no matter
      how hard I tried to remember, nothing came to mind. None of their voices felt
      unfamiliar."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044205797389
    m_Localized: "Did the virus ampoule shatter while fighting one of them? \nBut
      I couldn't remember who it was, or why none of them felt unfamiliar. My head
      was still in confusion."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044205797396
    m_Localized: Your first response?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044205797397
    m_Localized: "...I have no memory. My last memory is the moment the cure ampoule
      shattered. \nI don't know what happened in this facility either."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044205797398
    m_Localized: "Amnesia? Hmph... convenient excuse. The shattered ampoule is suspicious
      too. \nYou're a researcher and you don't know?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044205797399
    m_Localized: Still... I don't think that's a lying expression. There must be
      a reason why we were left here.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044205797400
    m_Localized: "Fox still didn't drop his suspicious gaze, but Retriever looked
      at me with a slightly softened expression. \nSheep and Rabbit looked back and
      forth at us with anxious eyes.\n(Affection for all characters +20)"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044205797401
    m_Localized: ...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044205797402
    m_Localized: Do you have no intention to speak? Or do you really not know? Either
      way, it's hard to trust you.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044205797403
    m_Localized: ...Can't you tell us? If you're a researcher here... you have a
      duty to let us know.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044205797404
    m_Localized: "At my silence, Fox's eyes grew sharper, and a look of disappointment
      crossed Retriever's face.\n Rabbit shrank back even more, while Sheep wore
      an unreadable smile.\n(Affection for all characters -20)"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044205797405
    m_Localized: "I looked back at the computer screen. Emergency system. Survivors.
      Infected. And vaccine. \nThe pieces of memory were slowly coming together."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044205797406
    m_Localized: "This was no simple research facility. It was a facility for treating
      incurable diseases. \nBut an unexpected side effect was discovered during the
      treatment process.\nA mutation where the human body changes to manifest animal
      traits. Beastification. Likely when the cure ampoule shattered... this transformation
      began."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044205797407
    m_Localized: Should I explain beastification?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044205797408
    m_Localized: I revealed the truth I had been keeping hidden.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044205797409
    m_Localized: Your transformation is very likely a side effect of the cure.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044205797410
    m_Localized: Side effect...? What do you mean by that?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044205797411
    m_Localized: Rabbit tilted her head with a confused expression.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044205797412
    m_Localized: Ha... then you're saying this appearance is the result of a treatment
      failure?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044205797413
    m_Localized: But... my physical condition has improved. It's easier to move than
      before.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044205797414
    m_Localized: Then... is the disease cured?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044205797415
    m_Localized: I shook my head.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044205797416
    m_Localized: "The treatment may have been successful. \nHowever, to reverse this
      transformation... a different cure is needed.\n(Affection for all characters
      +20)"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044205797417
    m_Localized: I said nothing.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044205797418
    m_Localized: 'In an instant, the four pair of eyes shifted subtly. Suspicion,
      anxiety, and uncomfortable silence.

      My saying nothing seemed to make
      them think I was hiding something instead.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044205797419
    m_Localized: Um... by any chance...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044205797420
    m_Localized: Sheep carefully touched the horns growing on her head.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044205797421
    m_Localized: Couldn't this be... a side effect of the incurable disease cure
      we received?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044205797422
    m_Localized: At those words, everyone's gaze froze for a moment.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044205797423
    m_Localized: Side effect...? That's definitely strange. But... my physical condition
      has improved unnaturally well.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044205797424
    m_Localized: Side... effect? What's... that?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044205797425
    m_Localized: Rabbit tilted her head.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044205797426
    m_Localized: '...Wait. If that''s true, didn''t you know about it?

      Why
      we changed like this... why our bodies got better... you must have known.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044205797427
    m_Localized: 'I couldn''t say anything.

      (Affection for all characters
      -20)'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044205797428
    m_Localized: Everyone realized the possibility that beastification was a side
      effect of the cure due to Sheep's guess.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044205797429
    m_Localized: "At the same time, however, suspicion was growing toward me\u2014\nthe
      researcher and the only person who might have known that fact."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044205797430
    m_Localized: So it means we need to find the cure, right? But is there any?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044205797431
    m_Localized: It might be displayed on the computer.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044205797432
    m_Localized: "In the direction Retriever pointed, there was a computer. \nI slowly
      checked the screen. And... I found numbers."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044205797433
    m_Localized: '---

      Vaccine Code: VX-01

      Storage Quantity: 2

      Storage
      Status: Normal

      ---'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044205797434
    m_Localized: There are only 2 cures. Someone can return to their original form.
      However... someone will have to live like this for the rest of their life.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044205797435
    m_Localized: Should I reveal that there are only 2 cures?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044205797436
    m_Localized: There are only... two cures.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044205797437
    m_Localized: Silence fell for a moment.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044205797438
    m_Localized: I have no intention of living like this. Never.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044205797439
    m_Localized: Don't be mad... Here! Eating something sweet will make you feel
      better.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044205797440
    m_Localized: "Rabbit handed Fox a candy, and Fox looked at her with a dumbfounded
      expression. \n(Affection for all characters +20)"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044205797441
    m_Localized: ...There are none.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044205797442
    m_Localized: Move.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044205797443
    m_Localized: She pushed me. It was immense strength. It was definitely a body
      that was weak until just a few days ago.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044205797444
    m_Localized: What is this...? Was I this strong?... I'm sorry.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044205797445
    m_Localized: Wait. Look here.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044205797446
    m_Localized: 'It was clearly displayed on the screen: ''Vaccine Storage Quantity:
      2''.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044205797447
    m_Localized: ...So you lied. To take the cure for yourself.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044205797448
    m_Localized: 'You. Were you planning to save only yourself from the beginning?

      (Affection
      for all characters -20)'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044205797449
    m_Localized: Three of us have to live as animals... This is...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044205797450
    m_Localized: Sheep seemed to be thinking about something while speaking.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044205797451
    m_Localized: Looking at the bright side, it means two people can become human
      again, right? Looks like we have no choice but to fight each other.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044205797452
    m_Localized: Wait... I think finding the cure is what's important for now...
      We don't even know if it actually exists yet.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044205797453
    m_Localized: At that moment, I knew. The most dangerous thing in this place might
      not be the virus.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044205797454
    m_Localized: 'What tore people''s hearts apart... was always despair.

      And
      in front of us... lay only two cures.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 862505767739392
    m_Localized: Retriever
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 862505776128000
    m_Localized: Fox
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 862505776128001
    m_Localized: Rabbit
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 862505776128002
    m_Localized: Sheep
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 862505776128003
    m_Localized: ' '
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 864038278340608
    m_Localized: Me
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 864850291400704
    m_Localized: ???
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1590383740395520
    m_Localized: New Game
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1590383782338560
    m_Localized: Continue
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1590383782338561
    m_Localized: Gallery
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1590383782338562
    m_Localized: EXIT
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1594374830366720
    m_Localized: Select
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1594374830366721
    m_Localized: New Chapter
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1603877646835712
    m_Localized: AFFINITY
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1603877655224320
    m_Localized: ITEMSLOT
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1603877655224321
    m_Localized: SETTING
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044205797390
    m_Localized: "Well... seems like we're trapped here, so shall we introduce ourselves?
      I'm Seojin Yoon. \nWell... no need to memorize my name, you can just call me
      Fox."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044205797391
    m_Localized: The person who introduced herself as Seojin Yoon touched the ears
      on his head and introduced herself sheepishly.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044205797392
    m_Localized: I'm Yena Kang... Um, rather than just a dog... please call me Retriever.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044205797393
    m_Localized: I'm Arin Do... Please call me Rabbit.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044205797394
    m_Localized: I'm the only one with horns... Well, I'm Seoyoon Baek. You can tell
      I'm a sheep, right? Just call me Sheep.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044205797395
    m_Localized: "Yeah, so how about you? What's your name? \nYou look like a researcher\u2014do
      you know why the lab was shut down?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044205797455
    m_Localized: "To escape, we needed to find clues to the emergency system override
      code hidden throughout the facility. \nBut that wasn't the only problem."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044205797456
    m_Localized: All of our bodies were slowly changing. It became clearer as time
      passed. This was no simple change.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044205797457
    m_Localized: Ha... my body is... getting stranger and stranger. It keeps itching.
      It feels like fur is growing.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044205797458
    m_Localized: Me too... As time passes, I feel like I'm gradually turning into
      an animal.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044205797459
    m_Localized: Then... does that mean we could completely turn into animals?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044205797460
    m_Localized: "No one could answer. Everyone's eyes turned to me. The researcher.
      \nThe only person who might know this facility. But I shook my head."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044205797461
    m_Localized: I don't know. I don't remember anything.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044205797462
    m_Localized: "Silence fell for a moment at my answer. Expressions of disbelief.\n
      Expressions of anxiety. And suspicion. Rabbit touched her changed ears and
      trembled slightly."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044205797463
    m_Localized: "Time was running out. If beastification continued, there was no
      telling what changes would happen next. \nWe decided to split up and investigate
      the 1st floor of the lab first."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044205797464
    m_Localized: It's huge here. It'll be faster to move individually. Let's find
      clues first and come back here.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044205797465
    m_Localized: "There were various facilities on the 1st floor: research lab, testing
      room, break room, storage, and archive. \nRetriever decided to investigate
      the testing room. Fox headed to the break room."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044205797466
    m_Localized: Rabbit, still finding it difficult to move alone, decided to go
      with Sheep.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044205797467
    m_Localized: Rabbit, let's go together.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044205797468
    m_Localized: Yes... I think I'll be fine if I'm with you, unnie.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044205797469
    m_Localized: I investigated the nearby storage room first.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044205797470
    m_Localized: Nothing special...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044205797471
    m_Localized: "There was still time before everyone was supposed to gather. \nI
      had to investigate another place."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044205797472
    m_Localized: Where should I visit?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044205797473
    m_Localized: "When I opened the door to the testing room, the interior was in
      a terrible state. \nBroken culture vessels. Glass fragments scattered on the
      floor. And unidentified liquid spilled everywhere."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044205797474
    m_Localized: Upon spotting me, Retriever stiffened her body slightly.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044205797475
    m_Localized: Why... did you come here? Her voice was laced with vigilance, unlike
      before."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044205797476
    m_Localized: "It was a natural reaction. We were in a situation where we couldn't
      trust each other. \nEspecially since I was a researcher here and had even lost
      my memory. Retriever slowly circled around me."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044205797477
    m_Localized: Wait... something smells weird.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044205797478
    m_Localized: She took shallow breaths, trying to trace the smell
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044205797479
    m_Localized: "However, nothing could be smelled around here except a faint scent
      of dust. \nWas her sense of smell sharpening as she turned into an animal?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044205797480
    m_Localized: Here... it smells like blood. And... that same smell is coming from
      you too.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044205797481
    m_Localized: "I was flustered for a second. Checking my body, there were faint
      wounds and hardened bloodstains left below my wrist.\n I couldn't remember
      when the wound was made."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044205797482
    m_Localized: "You said you didn't remember, right? But isn't it strange? \nYou
      were at the site of the accident... and the smell of your blood remains in
      this lab."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044205797483
    m_Localized: "She looked around the floor. And she found something beside the
      broken lab bench. \nA piece of a torn lab coat. My name tag was attached to
      it."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044205797484
    m_Localized: ...This is yours. Why is it here torn apart?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044205797485
    m_Localized: "Her expression wavered. It was closer to confusion than anger.
      \nShe wanted to trust me, but the evidence in front of her kept making her
      suspect me."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044205797486
    m_Localized: Please tell me honestly. You didn't cause this accident, right?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044205797487
    m_Localized: How to react to Retriever?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044205797488
    m_Localized: "I don't know. But if I were lying, I wouldn't have tried to explain
      like this to you. \nI also want to know what happened."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044205797489
    m_Localized: "Doesn't seem like you're lying... Then again, even if it were a
      lie, there's no way to know. \n(Retriever Affection +10)"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044205797490
    m_Localized: "Retriever still couldn't completely drop her suspicious gaze, but
      she seemed to accept my sincerity to some extent. \nShe held the piece of the
      lab coat and fell into thought for a moment."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044205797491
    m_Localized: I unconsciously hid the lab coat fragment behind my back. At that
      moment, Retriever's ears twitched.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044205797492
    m_Localized: ...Why did you hide it? You said you didn't remember until just
      now. So why are you hiding something that could be evidence?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044205797493
    m_Localized: The look in her eyes changed. My behavior was only increasing her
      vigilance.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044205797494
    m_Localized: That's important, isn't it? Hand it over.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044205797495
    m_Localized: Retriever approached quickly and took the lab coat fragment from
      my hand.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044205797496
    m_Localized: ...It's just a scrap. I'm sorry. I guess I've become too sensitive.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044205797497
    m_Localized: She smelled it and examined it closely, but couldn't find anything
      special.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044205797498
    m_Localized: "However, a deeper distrust than before remained in her eyes. \n(Retriever
      Affection -10)"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044205797499
    m_Localized: "Inside the lab coat she was holding, a faintly written serial number
      caught my eye. \nAnd strangely... the moment I saw those numbers, something
      flashed in my mind."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044205797500
    m_Localized: The exit's... passcode?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044205797501
    m_Localized: "When I opened the door to the break room, I heard the sound of
      someone rummaging through things inside. \nSomeone was opening drawers, checking
      the walls, and looking for something. It was Fox."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044205797502
    m_Localized: When she noticed I had entered, she slowly turned her head. Her
      ears moved first.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044205797503
    m_Localized: '...It''s you. '
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044205797504
    m_Localized: Why did you come here? To say you accidentally got lost... you're
      a researcher.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044205797505
    m_Localized: Are you looking for something?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044205797506
    m_Localized: A way to escape. And the cure.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044205797507
    m_Localized: She looked at her arm. Faintly rising fur. A changing body. Beastification
      that had progressed more clearly than at first.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044205797508
    m_Localized: It seems we don't have much time. Honestly... I have no intention
      of living like this for the rest of my life.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044205797509
    m_Localized: She looked straight at me.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044205797510
    m_Localized: But strange. You say you have no memory either... so why are you
      so composed?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044205797511
    m_Localized: I couldn't answer. Fox looked at me for a moment and then let out
      a sigh.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044205797512
    m_Localized: Whatever. It's meaningless to fight now anyway. Instead, I'll be
      watching you.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044205797513
    m_Localized: At that moment, Fox's ears twitched suddenly. She stopped talking
      and looked toward the corner of the break room.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044205797514
    m_Localized: ...Strange. There's definitely something there.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044205797515
    m_Localized: What did you feel?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044205797516
    m_Localized: A sound. It's very quiet, but I keep hearing it. Over there. It's
      coming from that bag.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044205797517
    m_Localized: "In the corner of the break room sat an old research bag covered
      in dust. \nIt looked like an abandoned item on the outside, but as I got closer,
      a faint alert sound came from inside."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044205797518
    m_Localized: Feels like someone hid this on purpose.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044205797519
    m_Localized: "When I opened the bag, inside was an old tablet and several research
      documents. \nAn encrypted file was displayed on the tablet screen."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044205797520
    m_Localized: '```

      Emergency Shutdown Code

      Emergency System Override
      Code

      Person in Charge : [OOO]

      ```'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044205797521
    m_Localized: And below that, there was my name.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044205797522
    m_Localized: ...There's an interesting name here.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044205797523
    m_Localized: My name?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044205797524
    m_Localized: '"Yes. Your name. And the head of this facility."'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044205797525
    m_Localized: She looked back and forth between the tablet and me.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044205797526
    m_Localized: Saying you lost your memories. Should I believe it? Or... are you
      pretending not to know?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044205797527
    m_Localized: How to react to the fox?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044205797528
    m_Localized: "I also... want to know how this happened. \nBut if I get my memory
      back, I'm going to urgently fix this phenomenon of turning into animals first."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044205797529
    m_Localized: Because I don't know what kind of problems might occur to my health.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044205797530
    m_Localized: I guess... if you knew, you would have sneaked out alone... Fine.
      I'll believe you for now.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044205797531
    m_Localized: But if you keep hiding something... I won't just stand by then either.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044205797532
    m_Localized: "Holding the tablet, the fox left the break room while keeping her
      guard up against me. \n(Fox Affinity +10)"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044205797533
    m_Localized: "I momentarily read her movements and lunged to snatch the tablet.
      \nMy strength and reaction speed had increased due to beastification, but she,
      not yet fully transformed, couldn't react."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044205797534
    m_Localized: The tablet fell to the floor and the screen shattered.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044205797535
    m_Localized: Wait... what are you doing...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044205797536
    m_Localized: She fell to the floor.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044205797537
    m_Localized: ...Hah... Now I know for sure. That you're hiding something.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044205797538
    m_Localized: She stood up and immediately checked the condition of the broken
      tablet. Fortunately, the tablet was not completely broken.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044205797539
    m_Localized: "Holding the shattered tablet, the fox glared at me and left the
      break room. \nHer eyes were filled with deep distrust. \n(Fox Affinity -10)"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044205797540
    m_Localized: "Having finished our individual searches, we gathered back at the
      central laboratory. \nHowever, the atmosphere had changed from when we first
      assembled."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044205797541
    m_Localized: At first, we were simply people gathered to survive, but increasingly,
      we were doubting each other's actions.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044205797542
    m_Localized: I found this in the lab. It's a piece of a torn lab coat... there
      was some sort of mark made with a pen on the inside.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044205797543
    m_Localized: I found this. It's a hidden tablet, and it had files related to
      the emergency system deactivation code. The problem is that it's encrypted.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044205797544
    m_Localized: I searched with the rabbit, but... we didn't find anything special.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044205797545
    m_Localized: ...Sisters... can we really turn back into humans?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044205797546
    m_Localized: At the rabbit's small voice, everyone fell silent for a moment.
      No one could be certain. Whether there were definitely two doses of the cure...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044205797547
    m_Localized: If they existed, who could use them. And... what would happen if
      we couldn't use the cure.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044205797548
    m_Localized: Everyone's eyes turned to me. The piece of the lab coat. The encrypted
      tablet file. The two clues were definitely connected.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044205797549
    m_Localized: But at the same time, these clues also proved that I was involved
      in this incident.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044205797550
    m_Localized: Should I tell them what I know about the clues?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044205797551
    m_Localized: "I checked the marks on the lab coat piece and the structure of
      the tablet file. \nAnd I explained, forcing myself to recall even the parts
      I couldn't remember."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044205797552
    m_Localized: These numbers... they're the same as my birthday, and this... is
      it some kind of initial?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044205797553
    m_Localized: Recalling the combination derived from the lab coat fragment, I
      entered a series of serial numbers
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044205797554
    m_Localized: "By combining the information I had, I was able to unlock the tablet.
      \n(All characters' Affection +20)"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044205797555
    m_Localized: I don't know. I'm just confused right now too.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044205797556
    m_Localized: Does this make sense? Your name is inside the tablet file?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044205797557
    m_Localized: Could it be... that you know but are hiding it?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044205797558
    m_Localized: I'm sorry, but... in this situation, we can't let you move around
      alone.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044205797559
    m_Localized: "If we keep changing like this... do I have to live like this for
      the rest of my life? \n(All Characters Affinity -20)"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044205797560
    m_Localized: "Under continuous interrogation, I eventually couldn't hide it any
      longer. \nExcluding the parts I couldn't remember, I explained all the information
      I knew."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044205797561
    m_Localized: The tablet's password was unlocked. The following text appeared
      on the screen.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044205797562
    m_Localized: '"--------

      Emergency System Deactivation Requirements:

      -
      Research Director Authentication

      - Final Security Key Verification

      To
      deactivate the system, please visit:

      - 2nd Floor Research Archives

      --------"'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044205797563
    m_Localized: Alright... so now we just have to find the last clue.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044205797564
    m_Localized: "We gathered all the information we could get from the 1st floor.
      \nHowever, the exit remained firmly closed. And there were only two doses of
      the cure."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044205797565
    m_Localized: Someone might not be able to return to being human.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044205797566
    m_Localized: We slowly walked up the stairs heading to the 2nd floor. The red
      emergency lights were still blinking.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044205797567
    m_Localized: And no one noticed. The changes in my fingertips... were progressing
      faster than anyone else's.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044205797568
    m_Localized: "As soon as we reached the 2nd floor, everyone's pace noticeably
      slowed. \nWith every breath, my chest felt tight, and an unfamiliar instinct
      writhed somewhere inside my body."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044205797569
    m_Localized: ...Wait. Is everyone... okay? It's gotten a little hard to move
      my body.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044205797570
    m_Localized: ...Me too. I have no strength in my fingertips. Could this also
      be a side effect?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044205797571
    m_Localized: ...I'm hungry... Can we... just rest a bit?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044205797572
    m_Localized: ...There are sickrooms on the 2nd floor. We'd better rest for a
      moment. We won't be able to hold out like this.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044205797573
    m_Localized: ...Alright. Let's grab some food first and take a short break.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044205797574
    m_Localized: "After gathering the remaining canned food and water from the cafeteria,
      \nwe headed to our respective rooms for a brief rest."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044205797575
    m_Localized: "Yet, I doubt anyone could truly rest. My mind was in turmoil, \nand
      I desperately wanted someone to talk to."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044205797576
    m_Localized: Who should I talk to?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044205797577
    m_Localized: "The door was slightly open. The inside was surprisingly tidy.\n
      On the desk next to the bed, there was an old family photo."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044205797578
    m_Localized: When I turned the photo over, small letters were written on it.
      '6 months to live'. At that moment, the door opened.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044205797579
    m_Localized: ...What are you doing? ...That. Don't touch it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044205797580
    m_Localized: The retriever took the photo from my hand, her eyes shaking and
      wary.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044205797581
    m_Localized: How to react to the retriever?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044205797582
    m_Localized: ...I'm sorry. ...It must have been a precious item.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044205797583
    m_Localized: "...I'm sorry. ...It's hard to hold back my emotions these days.
      \n...This photo is of my parents. ...They both... passed away from the same
      illness as me."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044205797584
    m_Localized: "...So... ...I came to this facility thinking it was my last hope.
      \n...I survived, but. ...I didn't expect to end up looking like this."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044205797585
    m_Localized: The retriever wiped away her tears, took a deep breath, and then
      put on a smiling face again.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044205797586
    m_Localized: ...Still. Isn't it important that we're alive? Having hope is a
      good thing.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044205797587
    m_Localized: Rather than despairing day by day... I'm going to live each day
      joyfully and happily.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044205797588
    m_Localized: Because there isn't even enough time to live joyfully.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044205797589
    m_Localized: "The retriever tried to smile, but her eyes were full of sadness.
      \nI quietly patted her shoulder. \n(Retriever Affinity +10)"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044205797590
    m_Localized: ...Let go. ...Let go!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044205797591
    m_Localized: "When I tried to take the photo, the retriever resisted violently.
      \nI ultimately couldn't take the photo and stepped back."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044205797592
    m_Localized: "...You came all the way to where I'm resting to do this? ...Please
      leave. \n...Right now... I don't want to see anyone."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044205797593
    m_Localized: "The retriever glared at me and slammed the door shut. \nA low growl
      could be heard from beyond the door. \n(Retriever Affinity -10)"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044205797594
    m_Localized: I heard a sobbing sound from beyond the door.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044205797595
    m_Localized: I want to go home...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044205797596
    m_Localized: How to react to the rabbit?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044205797597
    m_Localized: Are you okay? If there's something bothering you, I'd like you to
      tell me.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044205797598
    m_Localized: But... my body has fur on it and it's gotten weird...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044205797599
    m_Localized: It's not weird. I have fur on me too.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044205797600
    m_Localized: ...Really? ...You won't laugh?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044205797601
    m_Localized: "A moment later, the door opened, and the rabbit's body was covered
      in fur.\n Her large ears were trembling continuously."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044205797602
    m_Localized: ...What if... Mom... can't recognize me? Will I... be able to go
      back?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044218380288
    m_Localized: The rabbit looked up at me with anxious eyes. I comforted the rabbit.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044218380289
    m_Localized: "Thank you. I feel a little better. \n(Rabbit Affinity +10)"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044218380290
    m_Localized: I quietly tried to open the door. With a bang, the door shook.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044218380291
    m_Localized: Kyaa!! Help me!!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044218380292
    m_Localized: The rabbit was startled, and her cry echoed through the hallway.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044218380293
    m_Localized: ".. I moved to another place before anyone came. \n(Rabbit Affinity
      -10)"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044218380294
    m_Localized: "The fox's room was filled with documents and research materials.
      \nA clinical trial consent form lay on the desk."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044218380295
    m_Localized: "And. A battered old voice recorder. When I pressed the play button,
      \na familiar voice flowed out."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044218380296
    m_Localized: "(Recording): 'This cure has a fatal side effect that turns humans
      into therianthropes... \nWe must stop the research immediately.'"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044218380297
    m_Localized: At that moment. The fox snatched the voice recorder from behind.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044218380298
    m_Localized: Was it fun tricking others? Pretending not to know anything.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044218380299
    m_Localized: How to react to the fox?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044218380300
    m_Localized: ...I don't have my memories, but. ...That voice is definitely mine.
      ...I will take responsibility.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044218380301
    m_Localized: "...Responsibility? ...Is that it? ...If there were side effects.
      ...You could just fix them. \n...Why did you try to destroy everything?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044218380302
    m_Localized: "Without a cure... whether we turn into animals or not, we'll die
      anyway. \nDoes it not matter to you because you don't have an incurable disease?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044218380303
    m_Localized: She glared at me sharply in excitement, then calmed down and said.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044218380304
    m_Localized: "Still... thanks for telling me honestly. I suppose... \nif you
      tried to discard it when all you had to do was fix the side effects... there
      must have been some kind of problem, right?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044218380305
    m_Localized: Let's find the cure first. When your memory returns later, you have
      to tell me why you did that.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044218380306
    m_Localized: "The fox hugged the voice recorder and left the room. Disbelief
      still lingered in her eyes, \nbut her desire for the cure seemed stronger.
      \n(Fox Affinity +10)"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044218380307
    m_Localized: "I momentarily snatched the voice recorder and smashed it on the
      floor. \nThe voice recorder was broken and could no longer be used."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044218380308
    m_Localized: ...What are you doing. ...Do you think. ...destroying the evidence
      makes it like it never happened?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044218380309
    m_Localized: She glared at me with furious eyes.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044218380310
    m_Localized: ...If you do something like this one more time. ...I really won't
      hold back then.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044218380311
    m_Localized: "The fox pushed me away and turned her back. \nThe tail on her back
      wagged violently. Her anger was palpable. \n(Fox Affinity -10)"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044218380312
    m_Localized: Unlike the other rooms, the sheep's room was neatly organized. A
      small diary was placed on the bed.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044218380313
    m_Localized: Opening the diary, sentences written in her delicate handwriting
      caught my eye.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044218380314
    m_Localized: It was an intersection of her despair over her incurable illness
      and hope for your research.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044218380315
    m_Localized: However, on the last page, there was an unknown symbol and the phrase
      'A New World' repeated.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044218380316
    m_Localized: Just as I put down the diary and was thinking for a moment, the
      door opened.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044218380317
    m_Localized: Oh my? When did you arrive? ...What... were you doing in my room?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044218380318
    m_Localized: The sheep hastily hid the diary and waited for my answer.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044218380319
    m_Localized: How to react to the sheep?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044218380320
    m_Localized: I'm curious about the contents of the diary. What does 'A New World'
      mean?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044218380321
    m_Localized: ...You still don't remember? ...That drug... you tried to destroy
      it, didn't you?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044218380322
    m_Localized: Suddenly, my most recent memory surfaced... fighting with someone...
      and dropping the experimental cure.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044218380323
    m_Localized: Is that why the lab was locked down... and we changed like this?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044218380324
    m_Localized: Were you the one I was fighting with?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044218380325
    m_Localized: ...Why did you try to discard it? ...We were dying. This was our
      only hope left...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044218380326
    m_Localized: ...Side effects... can just be fixed.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044218380327
    m_Localized: ...Still. ...I actually don't hate it right now... At least animals
      don't lie.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044218380328
    m_Localized: For a moment, an eerie feeling emanated from the sheep as she said
      that.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044218380329
    m_Localized: "...Please don't... tell the others. \n(Sheep Affinity +10)"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044218380330
    m_Localized: I left her room. Through the crack in the door, the sheep was watching
      me. I hurriedly went outside.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044218380331
    m_Localized: I didn't see anything. I was just resting.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044218380332
    m_Localized: "...Hehe. That's a relief. ...I'm just... an ordinary patient, you
      see. \n(Sheep Affinity +10)"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044218380333
    m_Localized: The sheep flashed an innocent smile again. But her eyes still held
      an unfathomable light.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044218380334
    m_Localized: "I left her room. Through the crack in the door, \nthe sheep was
      watching me. Her dual nature confused me."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044218380335
    m_Localized: "The short rest was over. My body had recovered a bit, \nbut the
      beastification was deepening, and sometimes animal cries mixed in while I was
      speaking."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044218380336
    m_Localized: ...Let's go. ...Now. ...We must find the cure.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044218380337
    m_Localized: We climbed the stairs again. The 3rd floor. Hoping to find hope
      there.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044218380338
    m_Localized: Strangely, the door to the 3rd floor was not locked. But the moment
      we opened the door, cold air flowed out.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044218380339
    m_Localized: While the 1st floor was a somewhat organized research space, the
      3rd floor looked like a place someone had hastily abandoned.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044218380340
    m_Localized: We had now completely turned into animals.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044218380341
    m_Localized: ...This looks like there was an evacuation here.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044218380342
    m_Localized: It seems they really left in a hurry.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044218380343
    m_Localized: An emergency message remained on the wall.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044218380344
    m_Localized: '"===== Emergency Evacuation Notice =====

      Biohazard occurrence
      confirmed

      All researchers and treatment subjects are to

      move
      to the designated safe zone.

      Access to the 3rd floor research area
      is prohibited

      ========================"'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044218380345
    m_Localized: Did the rest of the people evacuate?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044218380346
    m_Localized: No one could answer. But one thing became clear.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044218380347
    m_Localized: If we don't find the cure, we will inevitably be isolated from the
      outside and trapped here.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044218380348
    m_Localized: "I felt my physical condition worsening. \nTo save time, we decided
      to scatter and search the 3rd floor individually as well."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044218380349
    m_Localized: Will you be okay? A young kid like you searching alone.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044218380350
    m_Localized: I'm okay. I've gotten a lot stronger.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044218380351
    m_Localized: The rabbit picked up a stone nearby and crushed it in her grip.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044218380352
    m_Localized: Hmm... you're definitely strong, huh?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044218380353
    m_Localized: Then, rabbit, could you search the patient waiting room since it's
      easy to explore and there shouldn't be dangerous items?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044218380354
    m_Localized: Yes. If anything happens, I'll run away. I'm a fast runner too.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044218380355
    m_Localized: Then I'll search the security room. Looking at the map, it's close
      to the patient waiting room, so I can help the rabbit if something happens.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044218380356
    m_Localized: "Alright. Looking at the map, the retriever and I will have to search
      from a bit further away. \nWe should also check if anyone else is left around."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044218380357
    m_Localized: After everyone scattered and I finished searching the storage room,
      I confirmed there was still time left. I think I could drop by somewhere nearby...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044218380358
    m_Localized: Where should I visit?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044218380359
    m_Localized: Upon arriving at the security room, a large monitor was repeatedly
      playing CCTV footage and... records from the time of the incident.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044218380360
    m_Localized: '"[Emergency Record]

      Time of occurrence: ??:??

      Hazardous
      material leak detected

      Cause: Needs verification

      Response:
      Facility lockdown"'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044218380361
    m_Localized: '"[Access Record]

      3rd Floor Research Area

      Accessed
      by:

      1 Manager-in-Charge

      1 Treatment Subject"'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044218380362
    m_Localized: "The record from the time of the incident documented the process
      of a virus ampoule breaking on the floor while the sheep and I were conversing,
      \nputting the facility into a state of emergency."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044218380363
    m_Localized: ...How is it now? Have you started to remember?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044218380364
    m_Localized: The sheep, who had approached from behind at some point, asked.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044218380365
    m_Localized: I see... I have a memory of conversing with someone when the virus
      leaked. Was it you?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044218380366
    m_Localized: But the important parts still elude me. Like a fog in my head, everything
      was distant and blurry.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044218380367
    m_Localized: Hmm... I guess you don't remember... Is this a side effect too?
      But I'm sure it'll get better eventually, right?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044218380368
    m_Localized: By the way, I have something I want to ask. How do you think it
      would be... if we keep living as animals like this from now on?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044218380369
    m_Localized: The sheep looked at me with intrigued eyes, waiting for an answer.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044218380370
    m_Localized: How to reply to the sheep's words?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044218380371
    m_Localized: "We are human. And... since the others became animals against their
      will, \nI have a responsibility to turn everyone back into humans."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044218380372
    m_Localized: Hmm... is that so?""
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044218380373
    m_Localized: The sheep approached me with a smile.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044218380374
    m_Localized: "\"But what if... there is someone who doesn't want to return to
      being human?\n If there's someone who says they are happier as they are now,
      what will you do?\""
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044218380375
    m_Localized: '"That''s... not allowed. If they refuse treatment to the end, they
      will be quarantined, if only for the safety of society."'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044218380376
    m_Localized: '"Quarantine... Hehe, as expected, humans are truly arrogant and
      selfish."'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044218380377
    m_Localized: '"In the end, if we don''t conform to the ''normal'' you speak of,
      you''re saying you''ll lock us up and control us again, right?"'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044218380378
    m_Localized: '"Is that the ''human ethics'' you desperately want to protect?"'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044218380379
    m_Localized: '"I did think that maybe, to some extent, having an animal form
      might not be so bad."'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044218380380
    m_Localized: '"It''s definitely a side effect, but the incurable disease was
      cured, and I can feel my senses and physical capabilities have gotten much
      better."'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044218380381
    m_Localized: '"Hmm... is that so?"'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044218380382
    m_Localized: The sheep approached me with a smile.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044218380383
    m_Localized: "\"That's right, exactly that! You feel it too, don't you? Our bodies
      have become healthy, \nand wouldn't it actually be better if everyone turned
      into animals?\""
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044218380384
    m_Localized: "Looking for a way to cure it\u2014that's not adaptation, \nit's
      'degeneration'. You've already evolved into a presence that is one step superior."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044218380385
    m_Localized: '"What... are you talking about? Are you saying you want to turn
      other unwilling people into animals too?"'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044218380386
    m_Localized: "This side effect isn't a disaster, it's a 'salvation'. It cured
      us who were just waiting for the day to die, \nand can make everyone pure without
      lies\u2026"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044218380387
    m_Localized: '"If this side effect is salvation, does that make me, the creator,
      a savior? That makes no sense."'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044218380388
    m_Localized: '"Savior...?"'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044218380389
    m_Localized: The sheep showed a surprised expression, stumbled, and then stared
      blankly at me on her knees as if realizing something.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044218380390
    m_Localized: Right... Maybe... you? It could very well be you.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044218380391
    m_Localized: The sheep sat with a blank expression, then abruptly stood back
      up as if nothing had happened.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044218380392
    m_Localized: '"I''ve searched everywhere here. Shall we go outside now? (Sheep
      Affinity +10)"""'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044218380393
    m_Localized: It was the space where patients stayed before the accident. Personal
      items of the patients remained beside the beds.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044218380394
    m_Localized: Nearby, the rabbit seemed lost in thought while looking at the items.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044218380395
    m_Localized: On a nearby sketchbook, several short texts were written along with
      drawings that looked like they were drawn by a young child.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044218380396
    m_Localized: '"Be healthy and come back to school!!"'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044218380397
    m_Localized: '"What are you looking at there?"'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044218380398
    m_Localized: '"I... went to school before coming to the hospital. Playing with
      friends, celebrating birthdays at home, I was healthy..."'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044218380399
    m_Localized: '"Then one day, I suddenly became short of breath and collapsed.
      All the doctors shook their heads... Mom and Dad cried every day."'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044218380400
    m_Localized: '"Then a man said: if I went to this research center, my illness
      would be completely cured, but I couldn''t leave until I got better..."'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044218380401
    m_Localized: '"So Mom and Dad sent me here with tears in their eyes..."'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044218380402
    m_Localized: '"It really stopped hurting. I stopped growing tall... my ears grew
      long... even though I really turned into a rabbit..."'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044218380403
    m_Localized: '"..."'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044218380404
    m_Localized: '"I miss Mom and Dad. I miss them so much I feel like I''m going
      to die... But if I go back like this, will Mom even recognize me?"'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044218380405
    m_Localized: Can I... go back home? The big sisters said the researcher might
      know.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044218380406
    m_Localized: How to reply to the rabbit's words?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044218380407
    m_Localized: "\"There is a cure, but... there are only 2. \nOne of us will have
      to live as an animal until a cure can be made again.\""
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044218380408
    m_Localized: '"2... Then if I get greedy, other people will have to keep living
      as animals.."'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044218380409
    m_Localized: '"I''m sure the big sisters want to return to being humans like
      me too."'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044218380410
    m_Localized: The rabbit thought for a moment, then clenched her small fists and
      looked at me bravely.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044218380411
    m_Localized: "\"It's okay. \nI can wait! When I last contacted Mom and Dad, I
      promised to stay brave too. \n(Rabbit Affinity +10)\"\"\""
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044218380412
    m_Localized: '"Of course, all of us can return to how we were. We''ll be able
      to get out soon."'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044218380413
    m_Localized: '"Really...? Can everyone become human and go outside?"'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044218380414
    m_Localized: '"... Of course, we''ll find a way soon and be able to leave. Don''t
      worry."'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044218380415
    m_Localized: '"... Lie."'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044218380416
    m_Localized: The rabbit's eyes turned coldly distant.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044218380417
    m_Localized: '"I heard it all from the big sisters. They said that even if we
      leave, being in animal form might make it dangerous for us..."'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044218380418
    m_Localized: "\"Why are you lying? I'm not a kid. Are you... coveting the cure
      too? \n(Rabbit Affinity -10)\"\"\""
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044218380419
    m_Localized: '"I''ll... go first. I''ve looked around here. I want to pack some
      of the big sisters'' things and hand them over."'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044218380420
    m_Localized: The rabbit brushed past me and walked out the door of the waiting
      room.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044218380421
    m_Localized: After the search on the 3rd floor was completed, we gathered at
      the designated meeting spot.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044218380422
    m_Localized: '"There were no survivors... It seems everyone evacuated."'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044218380423
    m_Localized: '"There wasn''t much in the waiting room... Ah, there were snacks
      and the big sisters'' belongings here too."'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044218380424
    m_Localized: The rabbit took out snacks, a pen, and a brooch from her bag and
      handed them over.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044218380425
    m_Localized: '"In the security room, all the CCTV data was wiped. But I found
      the security code for the research support room."'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044218380426
    m_Localized: '"The place we haven''t visited... then there''s only the research
      support room left."'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044218380427
    m_Localized: Everyone nodded, heading to the research support room in hopes of
      finding a clue to escape.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044218380428
    m_Localized: "In the research support room, records used right up until the accident
      remained. \nHowever, most data was damaged, and only one file could be opened."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044218380429
    m_Localized: '"---------------

      Cure Development Progress Status

      Body
      Transformation Recovery: Impossible (Maintains animal appearance)

      Rationality
      Recovery: Possible (Preserves human intelligence and self-awareness)

      Special
      Note: Low probability of additional body transformation occurring.

      Further
      verification required

      ---------------"'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044218380430
    m_Localized: '"...This cure isn''t perfect, is it? Besides... body transformation
      recovery is impossible?"'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044218380431
    m_Localized: '"Did you know about this?"'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044218380432
    m_Localized: I couldn't answer. I had no memory, but I felt as though I already
      knew this fact.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044218380433
    m_Localized: '"Huh...? What''s this blue thing on the floor?"'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044218380434
    m_Localized: The rabbit picked up something from the floor.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044218380435
    m_Localized: '"This is... a keycard used in the lab! Maybe because she''s short,
      she found it in a corner like this."'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044218380436
    m_Localized: '"I''m not short... In school, I was the tallest."'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044218380437
    m_Localized: The rabbit stood on her tiptoes to make herself look taller.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044218380438
    m_Localized: At that moment, the sheep approached and spoke to me.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044218380439
    m_Localized: "\"This is the last security deactivation code. Actually, I found
      it in the security room. \nHow about just the two of us taking the cure?\""
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044218380440
    m_Localized: Accept the sheep's proposal?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044218380441
    m_Localized: I tell her that the two of us cannot monopolize the cure.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044218380442
    m_Localized: '"How interesting... Maybe you''re not greedy after all."'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044218380443
    m_Localized: "\"I changed my mind. If you tell other people that I have the code,
      it'll be troublesome... \nHere, I'll give this to you.\""
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044218380444
    m_Localized: (Obtained Last Security Deactivation Code)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044218380445
    m_Localized: '"How you use it is up to you. I''ll look forward to it."'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044218380446
    m_Localized: '"Is that so? That''s a very satisfying answer."'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044218380447
    m_Localized: The sheep smiled contentedly and tucked the security code into her
      pocket.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044218380448
    m_Localized: "\"I'll keep holding onto this code. \nLet's look for a chance and
      run away just the two of us.\""
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044218380449
    m_Localized: '"Alright... then we can go to the basement with this keycard. Let''s
      go."'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044218380450
    m_Localized: The people around moved toward the emergency stairs leading to the
      basement without noticing the conversation with the sheep.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044218380451
    m_Localized: "Now we reached the basement where the cure was. \nHowever, the
      rare side effects of the cure, the possibility of escape.."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044218380452
    m_Localized: Even with several possibilities weighing on my mind, I couldn't
      stop my steps. The end of the incident would be waiting there.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044218380453
    m_Localized: And... my changes were progressing rapidly beyond control. As if
      I myself... was turning into another entity.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044218380454
    m_Localized: "When we went down to the basement, a massive generator was roaring.
      Damp, cold air wrapped around my skin, \nand the smell of metal stung my nose."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044218380455
    m_Localized: This was the heart of the facility, and seemed to be the place where
      all secrets lay asleep.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044218380456
    m_Localized: '"...Finally. We''ve made it here. My savior."'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044218380457
    m_Localized: "The sheep looked at me with a smile. \nHer eyes were no longer
      innocent. \nThere was only conviction and madness filled within them."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044218380458
    m_Localized: '"Savior? What is that supposed to mean?"'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044218380459
    m_Localized: We were all dying from an incurable disease, but... thanks to the
      medicine you created, we survived.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044218380460
    m_Localized: '"And... it seems your memory hasn''t fully returned yet."'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044218380461
    m_Localized: '"This facility, I built it."'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044218380462
    m_Localized: "\"The facility?? ...How is that possible? \nMoney, time... it would
      take more than just a thing or two?\""
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044218380463
    m_Localized: '"After my parents passed away in an accident... an inheritance
      came to me."'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044218380464
    m_Localized: '"At first, I just wanted to protect the ranch and property my parents
      left behind well. Creating a facility like this... I had no intention at all."'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044218380465
    m_Localized: '"But once I was left alone... people around me started showing
      interest in me one by one."'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044218380466
    m_Localized: "\"At first, I thought everyone was genuinely worried about me.
      \nBut... before the funeral was even over, they showed their true colors.\""
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044218380467
    m_Localized: '"''Who will manage the ranch?''

      ''What do you plan to do
      with the inheritance?''

      ''I''ll manage it for you.'' Lies like those..."'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044218380468
    m_Localized: '"Everyone looked at me with pity... but in the end, what they wanted
      was my money and land."'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044218380469
    m_Localized: '"Watching people swarm around me one by one, I realized. People
      only lie. No one was interested in ''me'' as a person. They were only looking
      at what I had..."'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044218380470
    m_Localized: '"Too cruel..."'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044218380471
    m_Localized: '"On top of that, not long after, an incurable disease... it really
      felt like the whole world was collapsing."'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044218380472
    m_Localized: '"With the sole desire to live, I built this facility and became
      the first VIP patient myself."'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044218380473
    m_Localized: The sheep stared at me and began to speak with an unfathomable expression.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044218380474
    m_Localized: '"However... the children at the ranch were different."'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044218380475
    m_Localized: '"When I cried, the dog stayed by my side in silence, and the rabbit
      was as happy as if she had the whole world with just a single carrot."'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044218380476
    m_Localized: "\"The fox... had a lot of playfulness so it was hard to approach
      easily, \nbut just watching her was enjoyable, and the sheep... believed in
      me and followed me without any conditions.\""
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044218380477
    m_Localized: '"There was no greed, nor betrayal there."'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044218380478
    m_Localized: '"...So you''re going to turn people into animals?"'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044218380479
    m_Localized: '"How is everyone right now? Isn''t it harder to lie than before?
      Everyone is becoming pure, aren''t they?"'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044218380480
    m_Localized: '"...That''s because of the side effect."'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044218380481
    m_Localized: '"It''s not a side effect. We are evolving."'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044218380482
    m_Localized: '"...You''re crazy."'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044218380483
    m_Localized: "\"Maybe so... But I've made up my mind. If everyone becomes an
      animal... \nno one else will be hurt because of lies.\""
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044218380484
    m_Localized: '"Big sister... is weird..."'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044218380485
    m_Localized: "\"Hehe... There's nothing to fear. Soon, you too will gain true
      freedom. \nNow, my savior.\""
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044218380486
    m_Localized: "\"It's time to make the final choice. \nInside that safe are the
      cure and the emergency system deactivation code, right?\""
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044218380487
    m_Localized: '"Together, we will evolve humanity. As you choose, a new world
      will open up."'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044218380488
    m_Localized: "The sheep pointed to a massive safe. The safe door was firmly locked,
      \nand a complex cryptographic device was attached above it."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044218380489
    m_Localized: I looked at my hands. My beastification had now reached almost the
      final stage.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044218380490
    m_Localized: "The animal instinct inside me was trying to erode my reason. I
      had to choose: \nprotect my humanity, or become the creator of a new world?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044218380491
    m_Localized: 'Final Choice: Agree to the sheep''s proposal?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044218380492
    m_Localized: Under the sheep's sweet temptation, I eventually fell to my knees.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044218380493
    m_Localized: '"Right, humans are hideous. It''s better to live as a beast instead."'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044218380494
    m_Localized: "I picked up the vaccine inside the safe. The eyes of my companions
      had already lost their reason. \nI dropped the drug on the floor and smashed
      it."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044218380495
    m_Localized: "At that moment, along with excruciating pain, the last thread of
      reason snapped. \nWe completely lost human language and crawled on the floor,
      emitting only beastly roars."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044218380496
    m_Localized: The sheep looked down at this scene with a smile.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044218380497
    m_Localized: '"Look, how peaceful and pure..."'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044218380498
    m_Localized: '"Don''t worry. In this perfect paradise... I''ll love and take
      care of you for the rest of my life."'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044218380499
    m_Localized: The facility doors were permanently locked, and it became a perfect
      cradle of beasts devoid of human reason.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044218380500
    m_Localized: "I flatly rejected the Sheep's sweet proposal. \nHowever, the Sheep
      was the one who held the emergency override code to unlock the safe."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044218380501
    m_Localized: '"Fine, Research Director... Then should I discard this emergency
      system deactivation code?"'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044218380502
    m_Localized: The sheep slipped away from us before we knew it and ate the paper
      with the code written on it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044218380503
    m_Localized: And with a smile, she swallowed the paper with the code written
      on it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044218380504
    m_Localized: There was no other way left. There was no way to escape either.
      I had to gamble.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044218380505
    m_Localized: With trembling hands, I divided the remaining reagent into four
      parts and injected it little by little into the veins of myself and my companions.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044218380506
    m_Localized: It was an incomplete and severely lacking amount. But amid that
      hellish pain...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044218380507
    m_Localized: "Taking a very long time, \nwe barely escaped after deactivating
      the emergency system without losing 'human reason'."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044218380508
    m_Localized: "We went down to the dazzling surface, \nthe village of humans we
      missed. But what greeted us was not salvation."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044218380509
    m_Localized: "People threw stones at us while screaming, \nand soon police responded
      with sirens and began arresting us."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044218380510
    m_Localized: "In the chaotic scene, the rabbit and the fox were dragged away
      somewhere. \nThe retriever and I barely managed to escape into the dark, deep
      mountains."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044218380511
    m_Localized: The sheep was right. The false human society did not accept us.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044218380512
    m_Localized: "I wailed like a beast as I looked at my hands covered in beast
      fur. \nWe were banished from human society forever and had to live the lives
      of beasts."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044218380513
    m_Localized: "\"You're wrong. This isn't salvation, it's destruction. \nIt's
      nothing more than denying everything we built as humans and running away.\""
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044218380514
    m_Localized: '"How foolish... In the end, you''re no different from those ignorant
      people. Living as a true animal is far better than living as a false human!"'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044218380515
    m_Localized: "Unlocking the safe's code, I found the vaccine inside. \nThere
      were only 2 vaccines. However, as the Research Director, I knew a way to produce
      additional vaccines."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044218380516
    m_Localized: "At that moment, the sheep lunged at me in rage, and 1 vaccine shattered.
      \nShe was restrained by the fox and retriever."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044218380517
    m_Localized: "\"Now... what are you going to do? There's only 1 of that important
      drug left, right? \nNaturally, it'd be best if you took it before losing your
      reason, wouldn't it?\""
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044218380518
    m_Localized: '"I will... take this drug and turn everyone back to normal."'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044218380519
    m_Localized: '"If only there was just one more vaccine, I would have kept watch,
      what a shame."'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044218380520
    m_Localized: '"Because you''re a trustworthy person. You''ll definitely turn
      us back, right?"'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044218380521
    m_Localized: '"I''m not a kid anymore... I''ll be waiting bravely."'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044218380522
    m_Localized: I injected the vaccine into myself. My mind cleared up and felt
      like my consciousness was returning...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044218380523
    m_Localized: After that, through the USB containing research data, I produced
      additional incomplete cures.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044218380524
    m_Localized: I administered the vaccine to everyone... and lastly, administered
      the cure to the sheep.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044218380525
    m_Localized: "\"Sheep, you said what you wished for was to live as a 'true animal'.
      \nBut a beast that lost its reason is not salvation, but merely destruction.
      \nNegotiate with me.\""
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044218380526
    m_Localized: "\"Support me with your influence and resources. \nI will produce
      a beastification drug where people don't lose their reason, and ultimately
      develop a real cure that turns beastmen back into complete humans.\""
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044218380527
    m_Localized: The sheep looked at me coldly, then accepted my proposal with a
      twisted smile.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044218380528
    m_Localized: "\"Fine, Research Director... Let's see how far you can reach. \nInstead,
      you must keep your promise.\""
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044218380529
    m_Localized: Under the sheep's support, our research facility conducted research
      even more secretly, completely blocked off from the outside.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044218380530
    m_Localized: "With the addition of the sheep's formidable financial power, \nresources,
      and everyone's cooperation, the stalled research rapidly began making progress."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044218380531
    m_Localized: "We haven't yet found a way to completely return transformed bodies
      back into full human form. \nWe are still living in animal forms."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044218380532
    m_Localized: "However... we will definitely find a way. \nUntil we reclaim our
      lost appearance and our stolen lives as humans."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044218380533
    m_Localized: "With trembling hands, I used the single remaining vaccine on the
      retriever. \nAs the vaccine was injected, a clear light of reason began returning
      to her murky eyes."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044218380534
    m_Localized: '"...Huh? My mind... feels like it''s coming back. But... why? Why
      give the only drug to me...?"'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044218380535
    m_Localized: "\"Because I was the one in charge. It's my fault for failing to
      protect everyone. \nEven if it's just you... survive and keep your reason.\""
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044218380536
    m_Localized: I wrote down an address where an abandoned house and a cave far
      from the research facility were located and handed it to her.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044218380537
    m_Localized: '"In the worst case, if you go here... you''ll be able to resolve
      food and shelter issues."'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044218380538
    m_Localized: "The eyes of the retriever who regained reason shook violently.
      \nThe extreme fear she felt while turning into a beast,"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044218380539
    m_Localized: "And her feelings toward you\u2014the one who had given up a life-saving
      medicine for her sake\u2014\nbegan to twist inside her mind in a strange way."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044218380540
    m_Localized: "To her, who was turning into a beast, this people \nwith no particular
      close relation willingly handed over a vaccine that was no different from his
      own life."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044218380541
    m_Localized: That fact left a strange 'imprint' in her shattered heart.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044218380542
    m_Localized: "\"Why...? You could have lived alone, so why to me... \nWhy sacrifice
      yourself so easily for others? \u2026\""
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044218380543
    m_Localized: "The retriever muttered softly, then firmly grabbed my wrist with
      eyes that had deepened further. \nIt was a strong force that couldn't be rejected."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044218380544
    m_Localized: '"Ah... I see... A person like you... is too kind and soft, that''s
      the problem."'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044218380545
    m_Localized: "\"I won't leave you alone in this painful world. \nAnd... I won't
      let a good person like you sacrifice yourself for others either.\""
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044218380546
    m_Localized: "No one can use you as a test subject anymore. No one can take advantage
      of you. \nRight here, where you led me... we can stay safe together forever."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044218380547
    m_Localized: "Possessing the sophistication of human intelligence regained, \ncombined
      with an obsession rooted in a dog's blind loyalty. I was dragged by her hand
      into the darkness where no one could find us."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044218380548
    m_Localized: "She began completely confining and raising me. \nThat was the only
      'requital' and 'protection' she thought of."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044218380549
    m_Localized: "The medicine cured her cold body, \nbut it could not heal her shattered
      heart or the blind obsession imprinted on you when she was losing her sanity."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044218380550
    m_Localized: "I was led by the retriever's hand into the deep cave. She completely
      confined me. \nI came to live continuously in this safe prison."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044218380551
    m_Localized: "With trembling hands, I used the single remaining vaccine on the
      fox. \nAs the vaccine was injected, a sharp light of reason began returning
      to his murky eyes."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044218380552
    m_Localized: '"This is... why are you giving me... the only remaining vaccine?"'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044218380553
    m_Localized: "\"As the Research Director, I have the responsibility for making
      everyone like this... \nAt least you keep your reason and get out of here.\""
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044218380554
    m_Localized: However, the emotion was brief; the fox suddenly clutched his head
      and collapsed onto the floor with a gasp.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044218380555
    m_Localized: '"Argh...! My head... feels like my body is breaking apart...!"'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044218380556
    m_Localized: '"Fox-san! Are you okay?! It must be a side effect occurring as
      reason returns, please hold on a bit!"'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044218380557
    m_Localized: "Regaining reason amid extreme pain, the fox's eyes twisted cold
      and frosty. \nThe pain of the hellish side effect set fire to his distrust."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044218380558
    m_Localized: '"Something is strange... My head... still hurts... Is this really
      a vaccine?"'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044218380559
    m_Localized: '"You... once I leave, you''re planning to secretly escape somewhere
      else, aren''t you? Or are you acting like nothing''s wrong?"'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044218380560
    m_Localized: '"No! I really did it to help you regain reason...!"'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044218380561
    m_Localized: "\"Shut up! While I was tied down because of this pain, \nyou were
      thinking of getting the real hidden cure and escaping alone, right?! Isn't
      that so?!\""
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044218380562
    m_Localized: '"I can''t take this because I''m anxious... If I leave you alone
      and go, I don''t know what you''ll do. I''m going to tie you up before I go."'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044218380563
    m_Localized: "Swept by madness from the pain of the side effect, the fox didn't
      even listen to my words and forcefully bound me tightly to a pillar, \nthen
      disappeared toward the exit with staggering steps."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044218380564
    m_Localized: "...How much time had passed? \nWaking up barely after losing consciousness,
      the low voice of the sheep reached my ears."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044218380565
    m_Localized: '"Hehehe... Did you see? How the ''human'' you tried to save at
      the risk of your life abandoned you?"'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044218380566
    m_Localized: '"In the end, humans lie and betray..."'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044218380567
    m_Localized: "\"Don't worry, Savior-nim. I will take good care of you. \nLet's...
      get along well from now on.\""
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044218380568
    m_Localized: "With my body beastified and even my reason paralyzed, \nI was taken
      in by the sheep. Like that, I remained forever as a collectible item of this
      bizarre facility."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044218380569
    m_Localized: "With trembling hands, I used the single remaining vaccine on the
      rabbit. \nAs the vaccine was injected, a calm light of reason began returning
      to her anxiously shaking eyes."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044218380570
    m_Localized: '"...Huh? My head... I couldn''t think of anything at all..."'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044218380571
    m_Localized: '"What a relief... It seems the cure is effective. Now you can keep
      your reason."'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044218380572
    m_Localized: However, as soon as her full human intelligence returned, the rabbit's
      face began to turn pale.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044218380573
    m_Localized: "Even the cure she desperately wanted failed to return her body's
      transformation in the end. \nLooking at the surrounding people who lost their
      reason and were becoming beasts, she was feeling despair."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044218380574
    m_Localized: '"My body... didn''t turn back into a human. The big sisters definitely
      said it''d be dangerous if I wasn''t human..."'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044218380575
    m_Localized: "\"Out there is dangerous... I'm so scared! Leaving here will be
      dangerous too... \nThey might experiment on me somewhere. They'll lock me up
      again!\""
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044218380576
    m_Localized: '"Rabbit-san, calm down! It will be difficult, but I will be able
      to seek help."'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044218380577
    m_Localized: "\"And... if help cannot be found, try going to the location written
      on this note. \nAs a last resort, you'll be able to live on a secluded island.\""
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044218380578
    m_Localized: The rabbit clutched the hem of your clothes so tightly it felt as
      though it would break.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044218380579
    m_Localized: "\"No! Out there won't work! I need a person I can trust... \nBecause
      you're the person who gave me the only vaccine... I can trust you, right?\""
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044218380580
    m_Localized: '"Come with me. Let''s hide, avoiding our world."'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044218380581
    m_Localized: "Regaining reason and intelligence, the rabbit's judgment began
      focusing solely on 'calculations for hiding perfectly'. \nShe forcefully dragged
      me and ran like crazy toward the emergency escape route."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044218380582
    m_Localized: ...After that, the rabbit dragged me into an abandoned house on
      a secluded island where no one could find us.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044218380583
    m_Localized: "She blocked every door and window leading to the outside world
      in layers, \nand confined me so that I couldn't go out the door."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044218380584
    m_Localized: '"Thank goodness... It''s safe here. No one can come. You and I...
      will never leave here for the rest of our lives."'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044218380585
    m_Localized: "The vaccine stopped the physical beastification and brought back
      reason, \nbut it could not fix the massive fear and broken mind that returned
      alongside intelligence."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044218380586
    m_Localized: "We came to live together like that in the closed darkness for the
      rest of our lives, \nbut the deep fear settled inside the rabbit's eyes never
      vanished forever."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044218380587
    m_Localized: Under the sheep's sweet temptation, I eventually fell to my knees.
      "Right, humans are hideous. It's better to live as a beast instead."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044218380588
    m_Localized: '"What? What are you talking about now? You want a world where everyone
      becomes animals? Are you crazy?"'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044218380589
    m_Localized: '"I felt a sense of incongruity right from the beginning... You''re
      not in your right mind..."'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044218380590
    m_Localized: '"U-Uh, big sisters... I''m scared... What on earth is happening...?"'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044218380591
    m_Localized: "\"Talking any further is useless. We're taking this vaccine! \nIf
      the three of us divide and administer it, we'll manage somehow!\""
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044218380592
    m_Localized: The personnel excluding me and the sheep packed up the vaccine and
      hurriedly left.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044218380593
    m_Localized: "Everyone abandoned me. They left, calling me a traitor. \nAs I
      fell into despair, the sheep approached and held out her hand."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044218380594
    m_Localized: '"Look... I''m the only one who understands you. You''re the only
      person who can change this world."'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044218380595
    m_Localized: '"You''re my savior. The only person who can reset this hideous
      world."'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044218380596
    m_Localized: I took that hand. Yes, this virus I created wasn't a failure, but
      the key to evolution.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044218380597
    m_Localized: "We captured the companions who had abandoned me and used them as
      test subjects. \nTheir screams became beautiful data."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044218380598
    m_Localized: Several years later. We boarded a large helicopter equipped with
      a completely refined evolution virus.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044218380599
    m_Localized: "Below the helicopter window, a dense forest of distant skyscrapers
      filled with humans living busily like machines came into view. \nHolding each
      other's hands tightly, the sheep and I smiled."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 147044218380600
    m_Localized: Fingers moved above the dispersal switch. In just a few minutes,
      I will become the new creator who flips this primitive world upside down and
      builds a cradle of beasts.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 458421147475968
    m_Localized: Bad Ending 1. Paradise of Beasts
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 458421189419008
    m_Localized: Bad Ending 2. Outcasts of a False Society
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 458421189419009
    m_Localized: True Ending. Reborn Human
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 458421189419010
    m_Localized: Normal Ending. Blind Confinement
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 458421189419011
    m_Localized: Normal Ending. End of Suspicion
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 458421189419012
    m_Localized: Normal Ending. Perfect Hideout
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 458421189419013
    m_Localized: Hidden Ending. New Creator
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 458421189419014
    m_Localized: Chose a peaceful paradise. However, at the cost of losing everything
      as a human.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 458421189419015
    m_Localized: Kept our humanity, but humans did not view us as human. In the end,
      we became beings who belonged nowhere.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 458421189419016
    m_Localized: Having regained everyone's reason, we chose to cooperate with the
      sheep. Though we haven't returned to human form yet, someday we will turn everything
      back.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 458421189419017
    m_Localized: Gave up freedom to save her. In the safe prison created by the retriever,
      I came to be protected forever.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 458421189419018
    m_Localized: Surrendered the last vaccine to help the fox regain reason. However,
      her distrust abandoned me, and I was left forever with the sheep.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 458421189419019
    m_Localized: Regaining reason, the rabbit feared the outside world. To hide together
      with me, the only one she could trust, she severed all connections with the
      world.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 458421189419020
    m_Localized: Abandoned by my companions, I chose a new world together with the
      sheep.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 860170857422848
    m_Localized: Frankly reveal amnesia and request an explanation of the situation.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 860170895171584
    m_Localized: Remain silent and grasp the situation.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 860170895171585
    m_Localized: Explain to everyone.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 860170895171586
    m_Localized: Do not explain.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 860170895171587
    m_Localized: Tell the truth.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 860170895171588
    m_Localized: Lie that there is no cure.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 860170895171589
    m_Localized: Search Laboratory - Retriever
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 860170895171590
    m_Localized: Search Break Room - Fox
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 860170895171591
    m_Localized: Frankly state that you do not remember.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 860170895171592
    m_Localized: Try to hide the piece of lab coat.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 860170895171593
    m_Localized: It might be true that I created it, but I have no memory.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 860170895171594
    m_Localized: Try to snatch the fox's tablet.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 860170895171595
    m_Localized: Tell what you know.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 860170895171596
    m_Localized: Say you do not know.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 860170895171597
    m_Localized: Search Retriever's Room
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 860170895171598
    m_Localized: Search Rabbit's Room
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 860170895171599
    m_Localized: Search Fox's Room
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 860170895171600
    m_Localized: Search Sheep's Room
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 860170895171601
    m_Localized: Apologize and comfort.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 860170895171602
    m_Localized: Try to snatch the photo.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 860170895171603
    m_Localized: Speak gently.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 860170895171604
    m_Localized: Open the door to check the condition.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 860170895171605
    m_Localized: Acknowledge it as your own voice and agonize.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 860170895171606
    m_Localized: Try to break the voice recorder.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 860170895171607
    m_Localized: Ask about the diary.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 860170895171608
    m_Localized: Pretend not to have seen anything.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 860170895171609
    m_Localized: Search Security Management Room - Sheep
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 860170895171610
    m_Localized: Search Patient Waiting Room - Rabbit
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 860170895171611
    m_Localized: Say you want to return to being human.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 860170895171612
    m_Localized: An animal form is also good.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 860170895171613
    m_Localized: Tell the truth.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 860170895171614
    m_Localized: Lie.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 860170895171615
    m_Localized: Say that the two of us cannot monopolize the cure.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 860170895171616
    m_Localized: Accept the sheep's proposal to monopolize the cure.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 860170895171617
    m_Localized: Reject the sheep's proposal.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 860170895171618
    m_Localized: Give up on becoming human.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 860170895171619
    m_Localized: The sheep is right. Everyone should become animals. (All Characters'
      Affection 40 or lower, excluding Sheep)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 860170895171620
    m_Localized: Take it yourself and promise to develop a cure. (All Characters'
      Affection 50 or higher, excluding Sheep)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 860170895171621
    m_Localized: Give it to the retriever.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 860170895171622
    m_Localized: Give it to the fox.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 860170895171623
    m_Localized: Give it to the rabbit.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1102193938079744
    m_Localized: Piece of Lab Coat
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1102193980022784
    m_Localized: Tablet
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1102193980022785
    m_Localized: Access Code
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1102193980022786
    m_Localized: It is a piece of a lab coat.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1102193980022787
    m_Localized: A tablet that still powers on. Inside the file, my name is written
      as the person in charge.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1102193980022788
    m_Localized: Paper with characters that look like some kind of code written on
      it. It seems usable for security devices.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 860170895171627
    m_Localized: Affinity
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1591015842979840
    m_Localized: 'The progress information of the current chapter will be lost,

      and
      you will proceed from the currently selected chapter.

      Do you wish to
      continue?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2146731674771456
    m_Localized: 'ITEM EARNED !! '
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2666628603387904
    m_Localized: Save Complete
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  references:
    version: 2
    RefIds: []
